    "description": "Deterministic, offline demonstration API over the merged Agent Workforce Composer v1/v2 planning surface. Synthetic data; planning only; no agent execution, permission granting or business-action authorization.\n\n- API contract: governance_studio.api.v1\n- AWC version: 0.2.1\n- Supported workflow contracts: workflow_ir.v1, workflow_ir.v2",
    "summary": "Deterministic, offline demonstration API over the merged Agent Workforce Composer v1/v2 planning surface. Synthetic data; planning only; no agent execution, permission granting or business-action authorization.",
    "title": "Ugence Governance Studio API",
    "version": "governance_studio.api.v1"
  },
